# Trivy misconfiguration exceptions.
#
# AWS-0104: The EKS control-plane security group needs unrestricted egress to
# reach AWS service endpoints and the public EKS API. Restricting it fully
# requires VPC endpoints and a deliberate private-egress design.
AWS-0104

# AWS-0132: The Terraform state bucket uses SSE-S3 by design. A customer-managed
# KMS key would add bootstrap key-management and per-request costs; the bucket
# is private, versioned, TLS-only, and public-access-blocked.
AWS-0132

# AWS-0164: Public subnets intentionally allow public IP assignment for the
# internet-facing load balancer tier. Worker nodes run only in private subnets.
AWS-0164
